   GET    /posts          List    (index)
   POST   /posts          Create  (new)
   GET    /posts/{id}     Get     (show)
   PATCH  /posts/{id}     Update  (edit)
   DELETE /posts/{id}     Delete  (delete)

 Next: go test ./... and dygo routes; try them at /docs.

Security: list and get are public; create, update and delete need a signed in user. Change it with -public-read, -write-role or security/rules.go.
